  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oye, aparta, que me vas a estropear la toma!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F00790065002C0020006100700061007200740061002C00200071007500650020006D006500200076006100730020006100200065007300740072006F00700065006100720020006C006100200074006F006D0061002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oh! ¿Me engaña la vista o llevas un Megaaro?\nEso es que eres un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa fuera de serie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aquí donde me ves, soy un prestigioso director...\nfamosísimo entre los amantes del cine B de nicho.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me gustaría inmortalizar la faceta más cruda de\nlos Pokémon salvajes de esta ciudad, valiéndome<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsolo de mi SmartRotom para un mayor realismo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El primero en captar mi atención ha sido un feroz\nPokémon que aborda a sus presas y les clava<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsus afilados colmillos... ¡Carvanha!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero... te seré sincero. Filmar tan de cerca a los\nPokémon salvajes tiene un peligro que pa qué...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡Me jugaría la vida!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A1004D00650020006A007500670061007200ED00610020006C0061002000760069006400610021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por eso he llegado a la sabia conclusión de que\ndebería grabar Pokémon que estén entrenados.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y ahí es donde entras tú en juego! Si me traes un\nCarvanha, sería un honor para mí hacerlo famoso.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No podremos empezar a grabar hasta que vengas\ncon un Carvanha en el equipo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Pero empezamos de una vez o no?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005000650072006F00200065006D00700065007A0061006D006F007300200064006500200075006E0061002000760065007A0020006F0020006E006F003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué nervios... Espero hacerlo bien.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500E90020006E0065007200760069006F0073002E002E002E002000450073007000650072006F002000680061006300650072006C006F0020006200690065006E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Jo, jo, jo! ¿Te importaría prestarme un rato a ese\nCarvanha que traes ahí?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Todo tuyo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054006F0064006F0020007400750079006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y qué gano yo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005900200071007500E9002000670061006E006F00200079006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te recompensaré debidamente, faltaría más!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400650020007200650063006F006D00700065006E00730061007200E90020006400650062006900640061006D0065006E00740065002C002000660061006C00740061007200ED00610020006D00E10073002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Venga, quiero a todos en sus puestos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560065006E00670061002C002000710075006900650072006F0020006100200074006F0064006F007300200065006E0020007300750073002000700075006500730074006F0073002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos con la escena del río! Luces, cámara y...\n¡acción!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200063006F006E0020006C006100200065007300630065006E0061002000640065006C0020007200ED006F00210020004C0075006300650073002C0020006300E1006D00610072006100200079002E002E002E000A00A1006100630063006900F3006E002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuidado! ¡¡Es un Carvanha!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004300750069006400610064006F0021002000A100A10045007300200075006E002000430061007200760061006E006800610021002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡Nos va a comer!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A1004E006F00730020007600610020006100200063006F006D006500720021002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nha... nha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00680061002E002E002E0020006E00680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Corten!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F007200740065006E002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tienes que abalanzarte sobre ellos con la boca\nbien abierta, Carvanha! ¡Que se vean los dientes!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Car...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300610072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh... ¿Señor director? He buscado en internet y...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002E002E002E002000BF0053006500F1006F00720020006400690072006500630074006F0072003F0020004800650020006200750073006300610064006F00200065006E00200069006E007400650072006E0065007400200079002E002E002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pone que los Carvanha siempre atacan en grupo,\nporque cuando están solos son unos cobardicas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cóoomo?! ¡Pues eso acaba de echar por tierra\nla escena que tenía previsto rodar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento... ¿Un Carvanha al que le dan miedo\nlos humanos y no al revés?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hmm! ¡Creo que podría funcionar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006D006D0021002000A1004300720065006F002000710075006500200070006F0064007200ED0061002000660075006E00630069006F006E00610072002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vamos a tener que cambiar un poco el guion,\npero me gusta cómo suena, ¡ya lo creo que sí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Carvanha que se achanta ante la presencia de\nhumanos a raíz de su timidez... ¡Cine del bueno!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por fin avanzamos un poco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0072002000660069006E0020006100760061006E007A0061006D006F007300200075006E00200070006F0063006F002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Carvanha son más monos de lo que pensaba,\nvistos de cerca.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0073002000430061007200760061006E0068006100200073006F006E0020006D00E100730020006D006F006E006F00730020006400650020006C006F0020007100750065002000700065006E0073006100620061002C000A0076006900730074006F0073002000640065002000630065007200630061002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
